<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Knock</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>knock &lt;door, thing or person&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>knock door
knock north door
knock coffin
knock Gandalf
</pre>
<p>Knocks on a door, a box, or someone's shoulder. Knock on a closed door, 
and those in the room on the other side hear the knocking. Knock on the 
lid of a chest or coffin you are shut inside, and those outside hear it, 
even if you have been buried. That makes it the way to call for help 
when you are trapped. You must be standing.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Open</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Lock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Exits</a>
</pre>




